# The node/e2e tests parse source files byte-wise (the e2e trace anchors in
# ext/test/e2e/run.mjs match bare \n), so core.autocrlf smudging the working
# tree to CRLF breaks them. Pin LF for the extension sources; add patterns
# here rather than flipping autocrlf. .ps1 stays untouched (ASCII-only files,
# CRLF conventional for PowerShell 5.1).
ext/**/*.js text eol=lf
ext/**/*.ts text eol=lf
ext/**/*.mjs text eol=lf
ext/**/*.json text eol=lf
ext/**/*.html text eol=lf
ext/**/*.md text eol=lf
